<title>LITHUANIA: MAZEIKIU OIL REFINERY IN PROFIT IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>MAZEIKIU OIL REFINERY IN PROFIT IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Mazeikiu Nafta oil refinery said on Monday that it had a profit in April of 5.9 million litas after posting a loss of 17.14 million litas in the first quarter of the year.  </p>
<p>The company also said in a statement that its turnover in the first four months of the year rose sharply to 520.7 million litas from 246.5 million litas in the same period last year.</p>
<p>It reported earlier that its Q1 turnover was 323.62 million litas.</p>
<p>In 1996, the company's losses reached 17.79 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
